 {"id": "T8", "kind": "fire-and-forget tasks in rule code", "where": "TaskHelper.RunSafely at Models.Relics/LordsParasol.cs:555, Rooms/TreasureRoom.cs:129, Rooms/CombatRoom.cs:262, Events.Custom.CrystalSphereEvent/CrystalSphereMinigame.cs:656, Rewards/CardReward.cs:556, :583, :587, Factories/CardFactory.cs:88", "note": "the synchronous port runs them inline at the call site; ordering against the caller's continuation must be checked when ported"},
 {"id": "T9", "kind": "hidden randomness", "where": "Helpers/GrabBag.cs:52-80 (rejection resampling), Extensions/IEnumerableExtensions.cs:9-12 (TakeRandom shuffles all), Extensions/ListExtensions.cs:10-33 (StableShuffle = List.Sort + UnstableShuffle), Random/Rng.cs:213-223 (NextItem draws even for one item), Models/AfflictionModel.cs:245-250, Models/OrbModel.cs:197-205, Helpers/SeedHelper.cs:13-31 (bad-word rejection loop), Models.Enchantments/Slither.cs (CombatEnergyCosts.NextInt(4)), Factories/RelicFactory.cs:56-67 (rarity thresholds 0.5/0.83 on NextFloat)", "note": "draw counts depend on data; port loops exactly"},
